Subject: [PATCH 25/26] player process info: the head tracker's battery after
 its position

Channels out under Virtual Sound ends with "Tracker 80 %" when the
service publishes service.virtualsound.allolive.headbattery.

Signed-off-by: allolive <160342668+allolive@users.noreply.github.com>
