+					<label>[COLOR button_focus]$LOCALIZE[472]:[/COLOR] $LOCALIZE[31642]$INFO[Window(Home).Property(service.virtualsound.allolive.head),  ·  ,]$INFO[Window(Home).Property(service.virtualsound.allolive.headbattery),  ·  $LOCALIZE[31643] ,]</label>
